Dear list,

Today I fixed a small 'bug' in MetABEL (values show on the vertical axis
of the forest plot [1]). While at it I also converted the documentation
to roxygen format and made some other small improvements to the layout
of the forest plots.

I've just uploaded these changes to CRAN.


Best,

Lennart.
