Yurri Aulchenko told me to send this email to correct a bug in the GenABEL-tutorial pdf used during the GWAS course of NIHES. On page 241 the following line is used:

Thus the pooled estimate of Odds Ratio from association between type 2diabetes and "Ala" allele is

Given the rest of the exercise and the answers, the "Ala" should be "Pro", otherwise the answer is inverted.



With kind regards,

Rebecca Steenaard
